ia</publisher-name></citation></ref><ref id="B7"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Singh</surname><given-names>Neeru</given-names></name><name><surname>Chand</surname><given-names>SK</given-names></name><name><surname>Mishra</surname><given-names>AK</given-names></name><name><surname>Nagpal</surname><given-names>AC</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Migration malaria associated with forest economy in central India</article-title><source>Current Science</source><year>2004</year><volume>87</volume><fpage>12</fpage></citation></ref><ref id="B8"><citation citation-type="other"><article-title>National Anti Malaria Management Information System</article-title><ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://mis.namp.gov.in/logon.aspx?ReturnUrl=%2fDefault.aspx"/></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>